From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 08:46:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nir/lower_subgroups: Fix vote lowering with vector ballots

nir_ieq_imm()/nir_ine_imm() return a vector boolean for multi-component
ballots, while vote intrinsics require a scalar result.

Reduce across the ballot components to ensure a scalar result.

Fixes: 62a4fe861af ("nir: Add an option to lower quad vote")
Signed-off-by: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Reviewed-by: Emma Anholt <anholt@igalia.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0c334c0cf048cd8128e01da51df85a576ca42b8e)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/44820>
(cherry picked from commit dc8e05ffc5ed2c47af66ec584a75d5191eab32af)
---
 src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_subgroups.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_subgroups.c b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_subgroups.c
index 9c92b6de3d8..66de5a989cf 100644
--- a/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_subgroups.c
+++ b/src/compiler/nir/nir_lower_subgroups.c
@@ -1021,7 +1021,10 @@ build_vote(nir_builder *b, nir_def *src,
       ballot = nir_iand(b, ballot, mask);
    }
 
-   return all ? nir_ieq_imm(b, ballot, 0) : nir_ine_imm(b, ballot, 0);
+   nir_def *zero = nir_imm_zero(b, options->ballot_components,
+                                options->ballot_bit_size);
+   return all ? nir_ball_iequal(b, ballot, zero)
+              : nir_bany_inequal(b, ballot, zero);
 }
 
 static nir_def *
